1
00:00:00,829 --> 00:00:02,789
I drive better drunk, you know?

2
00:00:02,997 --> 00:00:04,667
(Jimmy:)It makes you pay attention.

3
00:00:07,043 --> 00:00:09,213
(Leonard:)No. Come on in.
I'll make you a cup of coffee.

4
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:10,920
- I wouldn't be imposing?
- No.

5
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:12,630
(Leonard:)Yes.

6
00:00:14,801 --> 00:00:17,681
- Sheldon, we can't let him drive.
- Then take away his keys...

7
00:00:17,887 --> 00:00:20,727
(Sheldon:)...and make him wander the streets
with the other drunks.

8
00:00:23,226 --> 00:00:25,186
(Leonard:)You remember Sheldon, and Raj,
and Howard.

9
00:00:25,395 --> 00:00:26,895
(Jimmy:)Not really, no.

10
00:00:28,481 --> 00:00:31,981
It's funny, huh? Back in school,
I was the winner, and you were the loser.

11
00:00:32,193 --> 00:00:33,523
(Jimmy:)And now we're reversed.

12
00:00:34,404 --> 00:00:36,154
(Jimmy:)You're the winner.

13
00:00:36,364 --> 00:00:39,654
(Sheldon:)You'd think a winner
could make a decent cup of cocoa.

14
00:00:41,661 --> 00:00:44,661
(Jimmy:)- Mind if I use your bathroom?
- Yeah. It's just back there.

15
00:00:47,333 --> 00:00:49,213
(Howard:)How about that?
After all these years...

16
00:00:49,419 --> 00:00:53,299
...your big, bad high-school bully
finally apologizes.

17
00:00:53,506 --> 00:00:59,026
(Leonard:)Yeah. It kind of rekindles your faith
in the basic goodness in people.

